message: "If you use this console or data, please cite the accompanying article (citation details will be added on publication)."
title: "Lentil Digital Twin: console and microwave measurement archive"
type: software
abstract: >-
  Digital twin console and measurement archive for a 2-4 GHz free-space microwave transmission system with an
  integrated load cell, used to predict the moisture content of green (Ceren) and red (Ciftci) lentils over four
  harvest seasons (2014-2017). The archive contains 979 records at 41 frequencies with reference moisture content
  and gravimetric bulk density. The console replays the records through the digital twin (digital shadow level)
  with the predictions of the frozen models embedded.
